#: services/webservice/shell.py:523
msgid ""
"You are still signed in &mdash; no new sign-in is needed. The console has"
" just started and is verifying your identity; this page will retry by "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Sigues conectado &mdash; no hace falta iniciar sesión de nuevo. La "
"consola acaba de arrancar y está verificando tu identidad; esta página "
"volverá a intentarlo por su cuenta."

#: services/webservice/shell.py:525
msgid "Still not ready. Retry by hand when you are ready."
msgstr "Aún no está listo. Vuelve a intentarlo a mano cuando quieras."

#: services/webservice/shell.py:526
msgid "The answer changed. Reload to continue."
msgstr "La respuesta ha cambiado. Recarga para continuar."

#: services/webservice/shell.py:531
