#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5189
msgid "Attach to an existing instance"
msgstr "Asociar a una instancia existente"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5191
msgid ""
"Every instance that carries no server yet is offered, with the node it is"
" on — a server is bound on that node. \"Create a new instance\" uses the "
"node above."
msgstr ""
"Se ofrece cada instancia que aún no tiene servidor, con el nodo en el que"
" está — el servidor se enlaza en ese nodo. \"Crear una instancia nueva\" "
"usa el nodo de arriba."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5194
#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:220
msgid "Server name"
msgstr "Nombre del servidor"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5195
msgid ""
"The name of the new server (its key in servers.yaml) — and the Saved "
"Games folder name of a NEW instance. A name another server already uses "
"is refused."
msgstr ""
"El nombre del nuevo servidor (su clave en servers.yaml) — y el nombre de "
"la carpeta Saved Games de una instancia NUEVA. Un nombre que ya usa otro "
"servidor se rechaza."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5199
msgid "Configure a server for the instance"
msgstr "Configurar un servidor para la instancia"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5201
msgid ""
"On by default, exactly like Discord's own view. Off: a NEW instance is "
"created blank, with no server bound to it."
msgstr ""
"Activado por defecto, igual que en la vista de Discord. Desactivado: se "
"crea una instancia NUEVA vacía, sin servidor asociado."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5209
msgid ""
"The instance carries the ports; a new one gets the next free ports on its"
" node, and its Saved Games directory is created there. Nothing is "
"started: the server is created and comes up when somebody starts it or "
"the scheduler does."
msgstr ""
"Los puertos son de la instancia; una nueva recibe los siguientes puertos "
"libres de su nodo y su carpeta Saved Games se crea allí. No se inicia "
"nada: el servidor se crea y arranca cuando alguien lo inicia o lo hace el"
" planificador."

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5215
msgid "Add the server — it is created, not started"
msgstr "Añadir el servidor — se crea, no se inicia"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5220
