"<b>Node-wide</b> is this node's own block — its settings and the "
"extensions every instance starts from. An instance tab beside it changes "
"only that instance."
msgstr ""
"<b>Todo el nodo</b> es el bloque propio de este nodo — sus ajustes y las "
"extensiones de las que parte cada instancia. Una pestaña de instancia al "
"lado cambia solo esa instancia."

#: services/webservice/pages/node_settings.py:297
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This block changes only <b>%(scope)s</b>. It INHERITS everything it does "
"not set from the node's own block — nothing is copied."
